{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ca876884d9037616ab4531f6c6af6a5a27a4b02ac05eac15e501a195ee3e8a2", "ja": "（よし、今日の仕事はこれで終了。\nこの後はのり子と一緒に、食事へ行く予定だ！）", "zh": "（好，今天的工作就到此结束。接下来打算和野乘一起去吃饭！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "4744362afaf51026be4295bfb8e159be4f87d9a390b29d1b925a08a6c4d00bf0", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまっ！\nお仕事、もう終わった？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！工作已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ffe93266f1b37b401f346d3bcc3df7ee878dd84cb7cea49eb4da744ce5ea32e1", "ja": "のり子、ナイスタイミングだ！\n今、終わったところだよ。", "zh": "典子，来得正是时候！\n我刚好忙完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "e3eed57852a046efd4317b7496ff94d4f3eae92486b48a73c66b057f8d5270dd", "ja": "よかった！　それじゃさっそく行こっか。\n予約は{$P$}がしてくれたんだよね？", "zh": "太好了！那我们这就出发吧。\n位置是{$P$}订的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2473928211b44f60942c3fbb7c633070c45e119f39a9b714ab8a8377d7fe9a13", "ja": "ああ。焼肉食べ放題にしたんだけど……\nもっとオシャレなお店のほうがよかったか？", "zh": "啊。我订的是烤肉自助餐……是不是选更时尚一点的店比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "1e7b9265762665bfccf8b583e7d4df40f6020fc703c69e53d449524a06062985", "ja": "え、なんで？　焼肉、すっごく嬉しいよ？", "zh": "诶，为什么？烤肉自助我特别开心呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f1031a8c3241280805d08d2f0633b0f1f393eccf288e9f4ce1c04684ccfd6a2a", "ja": "いや、今日はオシャレしてるからさ。\nニオイがついたり、油で汚れそうだなって。", "zh": "不是，我今天特意打扮了一下嘛。\n我想着可能会沾上味道，或者被油弄脏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "f461ce8a13c32197a48db3cea10b300c711c34d9ece8332dc393dd211028cefb", "ja": "え！？　あ、いやこれは、新しい服買ったから、\n早く着たいなーって思っただけで……。", "zh": "诶！？啊，不是，我只是因为买了新衣服，想着想早点穿上而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "bd4bd62e104d1c9ccf3c8d417f6dba2cdd621aeb61ba52b8b9a31007ad6154c0", "ja": "だから、焼肉でも全然平気！\nむしろお腹減ってるから、食べ放題サイコー！", "zh": "所以吃烤肉也完全没问题！\n正好我肚子饿了，自助餐最棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9eafb7c0d8a270593d91121725b39f96588aeca1cb26b90d112f9add32086fa2", "ja": "そうか。ならよかった。\nしかし今日の服、のり子によく似合ってるな。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。\n不过你今天这身衣服很适合你啊，法子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "3b56f24ed54c5cf032b7443e2ee7cb6cf29a892541385412b06e2a4f15c4291d", "ja": "ホント？　えへへ、ありがと♪\n大学の友達と一緒に行って、選んでもらったんだ。", "zh": "真的？嘿嘿，谢谢♪\n我是和大学的朋友一起去的，让她帮我挑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "b12eec1d66c29268cf5918316be5181335a12c7fb98406c11c7cd1880a4ff16e", "ja": "アタシ、バイクに乗ることが多いでしょ？\nだから動きやすい服が多いって話をしたらさ……。", "zh": "我不是经常骑摩托嘛？\n所以我跟她们说，我平时大多穿方便活动的衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "94e2e8395c4bb94c4245e172699f5f210d87937ea09939d8187f5b3ba5420dc0", "ja": "「可愛いアイドル衣装が似合うんだから、私服も\n挑戦しよう！」なんて、友達に言われちゃって。", "zh": "“既然穿可爱的偶像服装那么合适，私服也可以\n挑战一下嘛！”朋友竟然这么对我说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fa09058b354897090e860f57fbf3973bbaab345ef5472f004dc93ac80f6817d4", "ja": "ははっ。普段と雰囲気が違って見えたのは、\nそういうことだったんだな。", "zh": "哈哈。难怪你看起来和平时的感觉不太一样，原来是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "1fc8cba5ec9f14b64e96f965f0a7727816c1ce9f06f333449d55d10954c0e2e3", "ja": "そうそう。正直、ちょっと柄じゃないかな～って\n思ったんだけど、試着したら案外いいかもって♪", "zh": "对对。老实说，我还觉得可能有点不适合我～不过试穿之后，发现意外地还挺不错的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1015_p", "source_sha256": "eacc2c90ad90fd058b6b107706da5f6774cb82838804baa3c1d79386874e8845", "ja": "ああ、俺もそう思うよ。カッコいいと可愛いの両方を\n取り入れてて、すごくのり子らしいな！", "zh": "啊，我也这么觉得。既帅气又可爱，非常有典型的典子风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "0548737f5857d7f78dd14d94f0eaf7a89baee74eb217035bc765bd3255925fb9", "ja": "えへへ、よかった～。この服、今日初めて下ろしたから\nちょっと不安だったんだよね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了～这套衣服我今天才第一次穿，还有点不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1017_p", "source_sha256": "71289177ce2a967ebd2bba24643efd4da1e0b668adb3b6c9ad478bf455e706a3", "ja": "そうなのか？　今日のために……？", "zh": "原来是这样啊？为了今天……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "75243dad4cab87e1f18a7c4d4f09582c6cf549daf81e6f8973afbb0df0bf4240", "ja": "……そ、そうだよ？", "zh": "……对、对啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0394_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "ebe007acdb4f941e3258446235a855a69c1c6a67acf06375e6489a39b30fccb7", "ja": "こ、今夜の食事、すっごく楽しみにしてたんだから！\nほらほら、早く！　お腹いーっぱい食べるぞ～！", "zh": "我、我可是一直超级期待今晚这顿饭的！\n来来来，快点！我要吃个肚子饱饱的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
